<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1TH" style="id">- Gedeo Bible</book>
  <para style="h">1 Teselonqeke Manni'a</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ergemallo Phawuloosixxa Siretixxa Erga Teselonqeke Manni'a</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Teselonqeke Manni'a</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Tes.</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ergemallo Phawuloosixxa Siretixxa Erga</para>
  <para style="mt1">Teselonqeke Manni'a</para>
  <para style="imt">E'yichchoo</para>
  <para style="ip">Teselonqe Meqedoonya hiyyendaaxxe Roomexxe galchake umo qachchamman: Pawuloosi Tesolonqe giddo Mageniixi tuuta safende'eek Filiphiyosi'i waale me'eechchi uduman: kaddo malee'e Yihudiinxa amana adhdhate'ee shiqeemmak gosa gosak ardi Pawuloosi shiqisha'neke amanatixxe erga'ni manni yaadik adheememaxxee Yihudi tennee gaabbexxi Pawuloosi'ni fuggoxxinni ke'neemman tennexxee Pawuloosi Tesolonqee waalexxi Beeri'a me'atee mudhdhe. Isinna hekki hiyyeexxi Qorontoosi geyeeshshanni isike shiqike gargaarsanjo kadeemmak Ximootosi Tesolonqee mareexxi higeeshshanni Mageniixe tuutta hexxeexxe yaanuwwaxxee mitte mittenda iso'ni ifise.</para>
  <para style="ip">Pawuloosi siretixxa erga Tesolonqeke manni'a borreesseek Kirsitoosito jajjabeessatenna dayyeessatetemman; amana insa'nexxeenna jaalala insa'nexxee eloxxa odo laqati Mageno galateefataan. Pawuloosinna insa'nexxe oddo'ni afemee wodda hittaxxexxa hedho hedheexxa insa'ne'ni qalli assa'nen; ookko'ninna Kirsitoosika langaka dago uuddaxxinni ke'eeke qortumuwwi'a hiisichcho uwwan; konne qortumiwwi giddi'ni heenok.</para>
  <para style="ip">«Kiristoosi hige dagabaan edi darre rerteexxi ammaanye Kiristoosixxi higa, ifisaaxxe duuchchi woddixxa hedho qoodema dandee'ata? Kiristoosi hige daga'neek haanote?» hiyyakeeran. Pawuloosinna tenne wodo la'oonfatati, «Kiristoosike langake dagixxa barachcho addeti heqqexxina'ni ookkone qico'ni salalik huje ha'nooxxa hucce» hiyya'ni insa'nee gorsaan.</para>
  <para style="iot">Konne Maxaafi Giddo Hexxeexxa Yaanuwwa</para>
  <para style="io1">E'yichcho <char style="ior"><ref loc="1TH 1:1">1:1</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Pawuloosixxa gammashshonna galata <char style="ior"><ref loc="1TH 1:2-3:13">1:2—3:13</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kirisitoositottixxe hedhoxxa akeette <char style="ior"><ref loc="1TH 4:1-12">4:1-12</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kiristoosike lnagake dagixxa barachcho <char style="ior"><ref loc="1TH 4:13-5:11">4:13—5:11</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Muuxamiinka gorsa <char style="ior"><ref loc="1TH 5:12-22">5:12-22</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Muuxa <char style="ior"><ref loc="1TH 5:23-28">5:23-28</ref> </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1TH 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 1:1" />Phawuloosinaa'n Sillaasinaa'ninna Ximotoosinaa'n Mageno annikenna Gootta Yessuusi Kiristoosike Kaddeexxe Teseloonqe giddo hexxeexxe Mageniinxe tuuta'a Mageno anna no'okik Gootta Yessuusi Kiristoosik Badhadhinna na'ge'i ha'no'aa kadowwaal.<verse eid="1TH 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Teselonqeke Manixxe Amanaxxe Shiqqeeka Galata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 1:2" />Soodachcho no'oxxe'n ha'noo qalli hina'ni duuchchi wodda ha'noo duuchchiingee Mageno galateenfanta'ennen. <verse eid="1TH 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 1:3" />Amanatenaa'n kaddeexxa ha'nooxxa huje, jaalalatenaa'n fiildaaxxa ha'nooxxe elo Gootta no'oke Yessuusi Kiristoosi'n afineexxe adde'naa'n dageeka ha'noka jabeena Mageni no'oki edonna anni no'oki edo duuchchi wodda qalli hinannon. <verse eid="1TH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 1:4" />Magenoke'n eeyyendineeke dayyuwwa isi ha'no'o fi'leexxa ege'neennen. <verse eid="1TH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 1:5" />Tinninna kaddeechchi wengeele no'oxxi ha'noba gelteek hunnati Woyyichchi Hafuurninna lumoxxe qalbeeffachchonnite malee haaso'i callinntebaan. Iittanni ha'no'a hinennexxi ha'noxxe oddo'n hitta he'nennaxxa egendine'een. <verse eid="1TH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 1:6" />Ha'no no'onna Gootta labbine'een; Fedhe qicinn jabaxxi rakko ha'no'ni gelteexxe kaddolenna hiyyichcho ookkone woyyichchi Hafuurixxe gammashshonni adhdhitine'een. <verse eid="1TH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 1:7" />Tennenaa'ni kexxeexxa Meqedooniya giddonna Akkaayiyaa giddo afendaaxxe amaanye'a eloke fakkeenna kadine'een. <verse eid="1TH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 1:8" />Goottiink hiyyichchi ha'nonaa'n fuleexxi Meqedooniya giddonna Akkaayiyaa giddo laqema calla kaddeebaak Magenoke'ni ha'no affineexxa amana duuchchi booncho'n ege'nende'een. Tennexxe no'o tenne yaane'n mitteelchonna haasoa'a hassissabaan. <verse eid="1TH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 1:9" />Hitta hexxexxe keessunsanni no'o adhitineexxanna hedhaakanna dhugaatika Mageno ergatemaaatee dharcha magenuwanaa'n hitta Magnibaa ille iima higgineexxa insa'ne umo insa'nenginni haasona'neen; <verse eid="1TH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 1:10" />Iittanni Mageni reyortnaa'ni ke'isseeka, iimi'n dagaak isik belti daggaaxxe mufenaa'n no'o anjiraaka, Yessuusi hitta heqqexxina'neexxa insa'ne haasonna'een.<verse eid="1TH 1:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1TH 2" />
  <para style="s1">Teselonqe Giddo Phawiloosixxa Ergatensha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 2:1" />Anke dayyuwwa ha'noobaa no'o dangennechchi tolakeete kaddebaaxxa ha'no umo ha'nongeninni egendine'een; <verse eid="1TH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 2:2" />Egendinemmashshanni konneechchi edo Philphisiyuusi giddo rakko adhdhinennexxi abara uundeenne; yaane kinni jabaxxi gibensha no'on gelteexe kaddoolenna midde Mageniinxa wengeele ha'no'aa lallabannoshsha Mageni no'ok shenunte no'o'aa uwween. <verse eid="1TH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 2:3" />Ha'no'o gorsinaannek gorsi ha'no dedhisatee yookaan battummatike yookaan shokkotike yaadinaa'nitemmabaan. <verse eid="1TH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 2:4" />Yaane kinni wengeeletixxa maganne adhdhiyyotee Mageni no'oo geya manna assee uudemmake mannishsha kande'e haasonaanen. Tenne assinaannechchinna qalbe no'oxxa afaaka Mageno malee'e manjo gammachchiinsonnaatebaan. <verse eid="1TH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 2:5" />Maxxisatika hiyyichcho hara haasonebe'noxxa yookaan illimollumma no'oxxa buqedhatee hinennenxi lame afo'ike kandebe'noxxa egendine'een; tenneexxenna Mageni no'oxxe'e dhugaa kula. <verse eid="1TH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 2:6" />Ha'nonaa'n yookaan wele hoone manjonaa'n afemaaka ulfinna hanisebo'non. Kiristoosixxe ergameeyye kandeennexxe qixxe'n ha'no'n silaati ba'ote kada dandeennannan. <verse eid="1TH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 2:7" />Yaane kinni ama belto ifixxee xexe'attammashsha no'onna ha'no giddo ballu'ntet mammaremmenne.<verse eid="1TH 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 2:8" />Mageniinxe wengeele calla kaddebaak hedho no'oxxeenna mitteba ha'no'a qoondona'a gammandano qico'n ha'no eenennen. Tinninna kaddeechchi ha'no no'o'ni eeyyendineemmaxxeten. <verse eid="1TH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 2:9" />Anke dayyuwwa huje no'oxxanna elo'a no'oxxa qalli hitinaan; ayye'ninna ba'ote kandabo'noshsha hashanna barra huccina'n wengeele ha'no'aa lallanbennen. <verse eid="1TH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 2:10" />Ha'no amandina'neke manni giddo he'nennexxi hitta woyyummat qullummat iita'n ci'ma belo he'nennaxxa ha'nonna Magenik dhugaa kuldinaan. <verse eid="1TH 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 2:11" />Anni ifixxe oose'a kaddammashsha no'onna ha'no mitte mittengee hitta kandennexxa egendine'een. <verse eid="1TH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 2:12" />Mootumma ifixxibaanna ulfinna ifikibaa ha'no ye'eeke Magni'aa hassissaa qico'ni hexxino'aa ha'no jajjabeesinnen, ha'no dayyeesinennen, jaaba qicinni ha'no'a gorsa uunnene. <verse eid="1TH 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 2:13" />Ha'no no'onaan laqqineeka Magenika hiyyichcho adhdhitinee wodda ha'no amandinaake manna'n dhugaati hujaake Mageniinke hiyyichchishsha malee manjike hiyyichchishsha assitine adhdha gophphineemmaxxee ha'nooxxe'e Mageno kuta belo galateeffantaannen. <verse eid="1TH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 2:14" />Ha'no koo dayyuwwa Kiristoosi Yessuusi'n hexxeexxa Yihudake bogi giddo hexxeexxa Mageniinxa tuuta labbine'een; insa'nenna Ayihudiinke manninaa'n rakko insa'ne'n geltammashshanni ha'nonna ha'noke ardinaa'n rakko ha'no'ni gelte'een. <verse eid="1TH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 2:15" />Insa'ne Gootta Yessuusinna wabeeko shinne; no'onna shorrinshe; Magnokanna gammachchiinseba'a; manji duuchchi'anna naaphake kande. <verse eid="1TH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 2:16" />Tinninna Ayihudake kadebaak manni anjiremo'a haasonnabenoshsha hoyyateten. Konne qicinni insa'ne cubbonde'ni hana cubbo lenba'ni me'inaan. Tennexxe muuxamake'ni Mageniinxi mufenna insa'ne'ni dagge'een.<verse eid="1TH 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosi Teselonqexxa Amaanye Uudatee Afeemmaxxa Halcha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 2:17" />Yaane kinni dayyuwwa no'o qalbe no'oxxnite kaddebaak maalik heenooxxe yanna'a ha'noonaa'n gargar hingonnolenna ha'no'aa anfennexxe lumoxxe halchanaa'n kexxexxa ha'no uundonaa jaba qico wo'laannenen. <verse eid="1TH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 2:18" />Ha'noobaa dagatee hanseennan; giddii'n ani Phawuloosi tennee heddo yanna wo'laaneennan; yaane kinni durriisi anee hoyye. <verse eid="1TH 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 2:19" />Gootti no'ok Yessuus dagaa wodda Isi edo no'oxxi adde yookaan no'oxxi gammashsho yookaan ifi saada no'oxxik kallachi ha'nootebaata? <verse eid="1TH 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 2:20" />Dhugaaten ha'no no'oke ulfinna no'oxxe gammashshonni.<verse eid="1TH 2:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1TH 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 3:1" />Tennexxee ossa dande'a gonpheennaxxe yannateee Ateena giddo no'oxxi qofi gata eloxxe kaddeexxa hendenne. <verse eid="1TH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 3:2" />Ha'nooxxe amana'ni ha'no dayyeessaashshanna gorsaashsha dayyo no'okanna Kiristoosixxe wengeelexxa huje no'onn welti hujaaka Mageniinke erganjo kadeeka Ximotoosi ha'no'aa ergineenen. <verse eid="1TH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 3:3" />Tinninna tenne hega uushshonni ayyinna lele'mabaashshaten. Tinni yaane no'o'ni kaddo'a murtessendeexxe kaddeexxa ha'no umo ha'nongenninni egendine'een. <verse eid="1TH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 3:4" />Dhugaaten, ha'nonni welti he'nennaa wodda rakko no'o'n geltaaxxa yanna yanna'ni ha'no'n kula'ennan; ha'no egendinemmashshanni hinenneshshanni kaddeen. <verse eid="1TH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 3:5" />Tennexxee harnga ossa dande'ebenoxxa yanna ha'noxxa amanaxxa ege'nonna Ximootoosi ergennen. Tennenna asssennechchi akimagaada iikki hega uuddalli ha'no hega uude'na'a elo no'oxxi duuchcha la'o affebaaxxe kadde gattaan hiyye sodaatennexxeeten.<verse eid="1TH 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ximootoosi Iyyedageexxa Gammashsho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 3:6" />Ta'a kinni Ximotoosi ha'nobaa'n no'obaa dageexxi ha'nooxxe amnaxxenna ha'noxxe eeyyuntexxa eloxxa odo no'o'n kule'een. Iittanni no'o'aa duuchchi wodda eloxxenni qalli hitina'neexxanna no'onna ha'no'o uudatee eena'ennaxxe qixxe'n ha'nonna no'o uudatee halchitina'neexxa isi no'o'n haaso'een. <verse eid="1TH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 3:7" />Tennexxe koo anke dayyuwwa seldo ha'noxxinna wixxixxi ha'noxxe amanaxxe duuchcha no'o ha'noxxee dayyanenne; <verse eid="1TH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 3:8" />Gottake'n ti'ni hitineexxi uurritinemmaxxee dhugaate'n ta'a tenne hedhoti he'nanno. <verse eid="1TH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 3:9" />Ha'nooxxe buutonni Gootta no'ok edo alfinennexxe gammashsho duuchchixxee Magenokee hitte qicika galatata isi'a shiqisha no'o'a hasissuta? <verse eid="1TH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 3:10" />Higgeen ha'no uundonna'anna ha'nooxxe amana'n xe'iteexxa ha'no'aa wonshinonna'a hashshanna barra jaba qicinni soodantannen. <verse eid="1TH 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 3:11" />Taa'nna Mageni no'ok Gootti isi umo insaneegeninna Gootti no'ok Yessuus Kiristoos ha'noba dangannoshsha ora no'oka no'aa isi qajeelchowaalta! <verse eid="1TH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 3:12" />No'o ha'no'a jaalala anfenneshshanni ha'noonna weli'anni weli affineexxa jalalanna welekeenna afineexxa jaalala Gootti ha'no'a birasa'issowwaal; lebe faqqaashshanna assowwaal. <verse eid="1TH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 3:13" />Gootti no'ok Yessuusi Kiristoosi ifixxe woyyoolenni welti dagaa wodda Gootta no'okenna anna no'ok edo ci'mabelokenna woyyoolete kaddineexxi afendinaashsha qalbe ha'nooxxa jabeesaan.<verse eid="1TH 3:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1TH 4" />
  <para style="s1">Mageno Gammachiisaxxa Hedho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 4:1" />Yoona dayyuwwa Mageno gammachchiissatee ha'no hitta hedha hassissaaxxa no'onaa'n baratine'een; ta'a hexxina'ee qicinna iittanden. Gootta Yessuusike summinni ha'no'o kadhantaannexinna ha'no gorsa'neki ta'anna konne caala edi'a assitino'aten. <verse eid="1TH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 4:2" />Gootta Yessuusike summinni hoone ajaja ha'no'a uunennexxa egendine'een. <verse eid="1TH 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 4:3" />Magenxi fedhi ha'no yabaabbuletenaa'n bayyatineexxi woyyondinaashaten. <verse eid="1TH 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 4:4" />Ha'noona'n mitti mitting ifixxa are woyyummatinna ulfinniki abixxa hassissaaxxa ege'no'aten. <verse eid="1TH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 4:5" />Tinninna Mageno ege'nebaake Ayihudake kadebaake mannishsha yabaabbultetixxe yortennite kaddoqqe'e. <verse eid="1TH 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 4:6" />Tenne yaanenni ayyinna qaxxamurexxi ammanye dayyo ifika dedhisoqqe'e; konnechchi edo ha'no'ni kulleneshanna xexxe'achchiisennashshanni tennee iitta hexxeexxa yaanuwwa assaakera'ni Gootti muraan. <verse eid="1TH 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 4:7" />Yaane kinni Mageni no'oo ye'eechchi woyyummat he'nonaate malee battummati ha'nonaatebaan. <verse eid="1TH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 4:8" />Yoona konnne gorsa adhdhabaak huuni manjinna Woyyichcha Hafuura ifika ha'no'aa uwwemake Mageno malee'e manjokebaan. <verse eid="1TH 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 4:9" />Dayyoomiinxee jaalalaxxe ayyinna ha'no'a borreessa hassissabaan; tinninna ha'noo umo ha'nogininni weli'aanni weli eeyya Magenokenaa'n baratine'een. <verse eid="1TH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 4:10" />Meqedooniya giddo hedha'neeka dayyuwwa duuchcha dhugaaten eetina'neen; yaane kinni dayyuwwa ta'anna ha'no gorsinannechchi caala eettino'aaten. <verse eid="1TH 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 4:11" />Konnechchi edo ha'no ajanjeneshshanni ifixxe anganni hucce; salalik hedhdhe; ifixxa yaane calla uude. <verse eid="1TH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 4:12" />Tinninna ha'no amanabaake mannixxe oddo'ni ulfinnik hexxinaashshanna hoone manjo'ninna ba'ote kaddinabaashshaten.<verse eid="1TH 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Goottiinka Langaka Dago</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 4:13" />Dayyuwwa adde afebake mannishsha yaadinabaasha amane reyemmake mannixxe'e dhugaa egendino'a eenanneni. <verse eid="1TH 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 4:14" />Yessuusi reyeexxanna reyotenaa'n ke'eexxa amannaannechchinni iitanni Yessuusi'ni amane reyeekaara Mageni Yessuusinni welti insa'nee iyyedagaan. <verse eid="1TH 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 4:15" />Goottakenaa'n adhinenneke hiyyichchishsha ha'no'n kulaannexxi yaane, no'o hedhoti he'naannekinna Gootti dagaa qico'ni turraanneki reyemmaka manna edinsabe'non. <verse eid="1TH 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 4:16" />Gootti umo ifingenninni lumok ajajinni, ergannatike sooresixxe raareninna Mageniinke malagatike hafuurinni iimi'ni dirraan; Kiristoosi'ni amane reyemmakirinna edise ke'aan. <verse eid="1TH 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 4:17" />Ookkonneechchi uduma no'o hedhotike kandeennekinna buttate'ni he'nenneki Gootta ayyarete'n adhdhinona'a insa'nen welti duumanchake'n iimi'a buttemannon, duuchchi woddi'anna Goottik welti he'nannon. <verse eid="1TH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 4:18" />Tennexxee konne hiyyichchinni weli'aan weli dayyeesse.<verse eid="1TH 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1TH 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 5:1" />Dayyuwwa tenne kaddaaxxe yaanuwwaxxee, yannatixxeenna baruwwiinxee no'o ha'no'aa borreessa hassissabaan. <verse eid="1TH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 5:2" />Tininna kaddaachchi moodhalchi hashsha dagammashsha Goottiinxi barranna iittanni daggaaxxa ha'no umo ha'noongenninni adda egendine'een. <verse eid="1TH 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 5:3" />Manni, «Duuchchiinxi yaane nege'aken hedhenegeechchi hedhebaan» hiyyaa'na ciniinto meyyaxxe'n daggammashsha iittanni ba'ne dadhange'n insa'ne'n daggaan; insa'nenna haranga baanje fullabaan. <verse eid="1TH 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 5:4" />Ha'noo kinni dayyuwwa tinni barra moodhalchiinsha ha'no'ni daggabaashsha ha'noo dukkana giddo hexxinebaan. <verse eid="1TH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 5:5" />Ha'noo duuchchiing ifiinkenna barrike mannan. No'o hashshike yookaan dukkanatike mannabaan. <verse eid="1TH 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 5:6" />Yoona dammanqo; no'oo umo ifika hirro malee'e mugaammake wele mannishsha kandonnoqqe'e. <verse eid="1TH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 5:7" />Mugaaki hashsha mugammashsha; machcho'akirinna hashsha machcho'aan. <verse eid="1TH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 5:8" />No'o kinni barrike manna kandeennaxxe'ee jaalalatanna amana qoma golle'namaake bagediink mi'yishsha oddo'wino; anjirematixxa adde ifi faachcheffantammaxxe bagediinxe gulleshsha umoke'ni uggudhdhino. <verse eid="1TH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 5:9" />Mageni no'oo ye'eechchi anjirensha Gootta no'oke Yessuusi Kiristoosi darree'n alfinannoshshate malee mufe ifixxa no'o'ni dirriso'atebaan. <verse eid="1TH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 5:10" />Kirisitoosi no'oxxee reyeechchi hedhoti he'noonole yookaan rennoonnole isinni welti he'nonnaaten. <verse eid="1TH 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 5:11" />Tennexxee ta'a assitinammashsha mitti mitte nossowwaal; weli'aanni weli dayyeesse.<verse eid="1TH 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Muuxamiinka Gorsanna Nege'a</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 5:12" />Yoona dayyuwwa ha'noo giddo hujeti elo'a'neekaara, Goottik ha'noke sooresuwwanna ha'noke gorsalluwwa kadeekaara ulfeesitinaashsha ha'noo kadhataannen. <verse eid="1TH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 5:13" />Hunja'neexxe hujexxee jaalalati insa'ne lumo qico ulfeesse; weli'anni weli ha'noonna nage'ik hedhdhe. <verse eid="1TH 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 5:14" />Dayyuwwa ha'no gorsinaannen; booso'a manna xixxe; hophphoola manna tirtirisse; gophaalye manna gargaarre; manjo duuchchanna osse. <verse eid="1TH 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 5:15" />Ayyinna fuggoxxee fuggoxxa hiissabaashsha heqqedhe; yaane kinni tenne irra weli'aan weli kaddo wele manni'a duuchchi wodda eloxxe kaddeexxa yaane assatee jabaatte. <verse eid="1TH 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 5:16" />Duuchchi wodda gammadde; <verse eid="1TH 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 5:17" />Duuchchi wodda soodatte; <verse eid="1TH 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 5:18" />Duuchchiinxe yaanexxee Magno galateeffatte; Yessuusi Kiristoosi darree'ni Mageni ha'noonaa'n hasa'nexxi tenneten. <verse eid="1TH 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 5:19" />Woyyichchi Hafuurixxa huje buqqinoqqe'e. <verse eid="1TH 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 5:20" />Raaga tuffatinoqqe'e; <verse eid="1TH 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TH 5:21" />Duuchchiinxa yaane hega uudde; eloxxe kaddeexxa abixxe. <verse eid="1TH 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1TH 5:22" />Heene fuggoxxe yaanenaa'n bayyatte.<verse eid="1TH 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1TH 5:23" />Nage'ink Mageni isi umo ifingenninni ha'no hara woyyonsowwaal. Irri ha'nok, lubbo ha'nooxxinna maali ha'nok Gootti Yessuusi Kiristoosi dagaa wodda ci'mema belo heqqemeexxi hedhowwaal. <verse eid="1TH 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1TH 5:24" />Dayyuwwa ha'noo ye'eeki amanemeeke kademmaxxee isi tenne assaan. <verse eid="1TH 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1TH 5:25" />Dayyuwwaa! No'aanna soodatte. <verse eid="1TH 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1TH 5:26" />Dayyuwwa duuchcha woyyummatixxe sunqeccanni weli'aan weli nage'a aadhdhe. <verse eid="1TH 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1TH 5:27" />Tinni erga amaagne dayyuwwi duuchchi'a haassesendaashsha ha'noo Goottik maganne hiyyaannen. <verse eid="1TH 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1TH 5:28" />Gootti no'okiki Yessuusi Kiristoosik badhaadhi ha'noonni welti hedhowwaal.<verse eid="1TH 5:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 5" />
</usx>